            "value": "用來測試 bugtraq:regex 的記錄訊息範本. \n\n測試在段落中所提到問題: Mention single issue #55. Mention issues #77, #78, and #79. Mention more issues #123, #124 and #125 and some more separate ones: Issue #45, issue #46 and issue #47.\n\n\nUpdate issue #101\nFixes issue #202\nFixed issue #123\nResolves issue #88.\nCloses issue #99.\n"
